      <h2>Permitted Investment Strategies Under SIF</h2>
      <p>
        Unlike plain-vanilla mutual funds that are mandated to remain 65%+ or 80%+ long equity regardless of market bubbles, SIF schemes can deploy specialized strategies to capture alpha and protect downside:
      </p>

