      <h2>How Daily NAV Updates Work via Official AMFI SIF API</h2>
      <p>
        Because SIF schemes operate under the mutual fund trust regulatory architecture, AMFI publishes official daily NAVs every business evening. AMFI created an official dedicated API endpoint:
      </p>
      <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #a78bfa; margin: 1.5rem 0; word-break: break-all; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">
        https://www.amfiindia.com/api/sif-latest-nav
      </div>
      <p>
        When AMCs publish NAV data at the end of each market day, this endpoint yields scheme identifiers, ISIN codes, repurchase prices, and daily Net Asset Values.
      </p>

