            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Yes. Specialized Investment Funds operate under SEBI's Mutual Fund Regulations with specialized carve-outs for the New Asset Class. This provides statutory custodian protections, independent trusteeship, and transparent NAV disclosures.
            </p>
          </div>

